	(text "JP's 2, 3, 4, and 5 break out the\nLED anode and switch pin 1.\nIf multiple switches and/or LEDs\nare connected in a matrix, these\npins can be interconnected to form\nthe COLUMNS of the matrix.\nThe four headers are arranged to\nallow connecting boards straight-on,\nor at 3/8\" or 3/16\" offsets."
